	(text_box "STM32WL55CCU6 SETUP NOTES:\n- The HSE Clipped Sine Oscillator (TCXO) is powered by PB0_VDD_TCXO+ on the MCU.\n  1. Run the MCU on the intrenal LSI\n  2. Enable the power supply\n  3. Wait for the TCXO to start (max 2mS)\n  4. Switch to HSE\n\n- The MCU LSE (32.7 KHz) is turned ON through CTRL pin on SMPS TPS62740DSSR and power by the LOAD power pin.\n  1. Run the MCU on the intrenal LSI\n  2. Set the CTRL pin on SMPS TPS62740DSSR to HIGH (Enables the LOAD power pin)\n  3. Wait for the TCXO to start\n  4. Set MCU clock to LSE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 21.59 0)
		(size 81.28 41.91)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
